{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"bea4176d317fa0ef","type":"text","text":"[[The Feywild]]\n\n[[Lilette Torvir (Revilya).canvas]]\n\n#FeyWild ","x":-1440,"y":-1440,"width":280,"height":140},
		{"id":"3d864da0c3a2a2b5","x":-520,"y":-1080,"width":119,"height":50,"type":"text","text":"Grounds"},
		{"id":"f682db9c4a34a9ac","x":-1340,"y":-860,"width":693,"height":258,"type":"text","text":"Garden of Pixies:\n\nA lush garden of twisting vines and trees. \n\nThe garden is a stone walkway that leads to a crossroads in the center is a Monopteros surrounding it is the stone walkway and thousands of pixies flying around in the pink and purple light fog. The crossway is sided with well kept purple shrubs and the garden itself is a beautiful scattering of different weird fruits and vegetables that the material plane definitely does not have.\n"},
		{"id":"ed65e0566807f244","x":-280,"y":-500,"width":595,"height":237,"type":"text","text":"Field of flowers:\n\nA field that goes as far as the eye can see with all different coloured flowers, the pollen coming from the flowers paints into the beautiful hue encompassing it. \n\nIn this field lies an unmarked grave at the bottom of a singular golden tree.\n"},
		{"id":"fa03ecd7005f4994","x":760,"y":-500,"width":607,"height":333,"type":"text","text":"The Deck:\n\nFrom the top of the clouds the beautiful open fields of the Feywild stretch out as far as the eye can see. Strange bird like creatures flying through the skies during the day and pleasant scent of lavender is always present.\nThis wooden deck wraps up the side of the tree and on the trunk holes are carved out one is a door the rest windows. Resting on a circular platform at the top of the staircase there is a sitting area and a bed that overlooks the beautiful view. Made a soft material coloured in purple and blue it has a beautiful mosquito net hanging from a top branch made of green linen. Beside the bed is a very large bath that overlooks the same beautiful view and the water silently pours from the top of tree into it then down from the home to the ground beneath.\n"},
		{"id":"34ffe533aa003726","x":1480,"y":-910,"width":146,"height":50,"type":"text","text":"Her Home:\n"},
		{"id":"a0c1d8a7ba794155","x":1720,"y":-500,"width":740,"height":300,"type":"text","text":"Inside main area:\n\nThe interior is made of wood with holes in the trunk all around and 7 door ways 5 of which open and leading into bedrooms. \n\nThe main area is a circular room with a kitchen that feels very Muskoka cottage like and in the center a of the room there is a large table with a scattering of strange fruits and meets. \n\nThe very far right room leads to a wine cellar and to the left of that is her study. \n\n\nAcross from that is a couch that is at the bottom of a stage where someone could perform for Revilyas entertainment. To the right of the couch a open window gazing at the view of the Feywild.\n"},
		{"id":"383e56f7ba1fd551","x":560,"y":-120,"width":833,"height":674,"type":"text","text":"The Study:\n\nAt the far end of the room is a open balcony with glass doors. On both sides of the room there are book shelves that scale to the roof where  a large branch covered in leaves ranges from one side of the ceiling to the other. In the center of the room theres a desk made of wood and a cushioned high chair on wheels. Currently on the desk there is a map of a place called the \"Twisting Blight lands\". \n\nRandom book names and ideas\n\nPink book called \"Pixies Paradise\" talks about a land far south filled with pixies where night never falls. \n\nBlue book called \"Waving Waters\" A ocean to the north where the wat is both blue and purple, creatures living there range from peaceful dryads to squid like monsters that are the size of mountains.\n\nRed Book called \"The rifts\" written by Revilya it talks about rifts from the hells that continue to pop up all around the Feywild and how she has continuously been the only Arch Fey to close them and all by herself.\n\nGreen book called \"Herbalism\" It talks about weird plants in the Feywild one sticks out called Pixras a green stemmed rose like flower that emits a toxic gas when touched poisoning any creature in the area. \n\nDark Purple book labelled \"The Sea above\" it talks about Revilyas thoughts on the Astral Sea and how its directly linked to the Raven Queen. She thinks that the Raven Queens body exists there looking down on all the other planes guarding them from horrors.\n\nBrown Book labelled \"I Miss Home\" Written by Revilya it talks about how every once and awhile Lillette pokes out and she writes in this journal talking about how she both misses home and loves her new life. She wishes she could share it with her family.\n"},
		{"id":"5cc7bbb1f4b7b99f","x":1350,"y":-1140,"width":407,"height":120,"type":"text","text":"At the top of the Tree of life which scrapes the pink clouds is a strange wooden structure hanging on the ground beneath it is a sigil that when stepped on transports you to the home at the top.\n"},
		{"id":"23a3ca21e9e3be7e","x":-1282,"y":-500,"width":635,"height":217,"type":"text","text":"Lake of Slumber:\n\nResting within a lake of a bright pink water are hundreds of different creatures both sleeping and dead. The lake is surrounded by trees that have water flowing from their branches into the lake this water seems to just come from the trees themselves. \n\nThere is a dryad named Rosalin she is very shy and is Ravilyas best friend.\n"},
		{"id":"cccca12333cdf553","x":-220,"y":-960,"width":893,"height":358,"type":"text","text":"Tree of Life (Eringar):\n\nThis tree in the center of the sanctuary is hundreds of feet tell with all different coloured leaves. A perpetual mist drifts from the tree to the ground supplying life to the grounds and creating the life of some on the lesser fey creatures that reside in the domain.\n\nThis tree holds a fraction of Revilyas soul and if it were to parish so would she. \n\nTwisting branches and a bright blue trunk with a bark that feels similar to that of a tree found on the material plane. This tree is a beautiful sight and can speak to people who it deems worthy.\n\nUnaware to her this tree is the very thing that turned her into an Arch fey. It required the power of a being blessed by magic in order to survive and the longer it lives the further its life will spread through the realm.\n"}
	],
